L001125	when approaching criticality at $K_{\rm{crit}}\approx 1.92$.
L001126	This implies that the Adler equation and its solution become less valid closer to criticality.
L001127	Hence, the quality of our theory depends on the value of the coupling strength $K$.
L001128	Indeed, Figure 2(c) in the main text illustrates that our theory works well
L001129	for coupling strengths sufficiently far from criticality,
L001130	and gets worse the closer we approach criticality.
